,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vam"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa49e3fb-5b99-4480-8e05-8b10818bdb2b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕が体験したのは、VMで開発しててマウントしてたファイルシステムのIO(stat)がめっちゃ遅くて、1回のリロードで2分とかかかるやつw 当時はマウントしたところから別の場所にrsyncすることで速くした。","ts":"1617257726.058200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vT8jz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1ad62d0-8fb6-4e17-872a-1ce3afc68c00","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"たしかにむちゃくちゃ無用なデータ引いちゃってないかな？とか気になりますね。","ts":"1617257603.056500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4dS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11cf0799-9c68-47ce-a0ad-a12a73907b98","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Rubyそのものはいまや決して遅くないですからね。特にGraphQL的なタスクだからといってRubyの秘孔を突くとは考えにくいし。","ts":"1617257489.056000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+1nA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11964467-c12a-40ec-bb6f-86724cdf665b","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"確かに、どこで詰っているかは確認しておきたいですね。なんとなく slow query な気がしますけど。","ts":"1617257105.055000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jD5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"191af398-60fb-4372-b0b4-9e69ce24ed39","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一応、遅い理由は調べておいたほうが良いかもよ? もしくはしかるべき人たちに依頼するとか。","ts":"1617256915.053700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aVM6D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d04d8e6-1678-4107-b147-76cd8ea58d5a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"graphql-rubyが遅すぎてfetchに5秒かかって死んでたページで、SPAだから前のページで投機的にクエリぶん投げることで体感大体1秒以下にできた回","ts":"1617251336.052500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":3,"users":["UEACRCY0Z","U72TB62UF","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lb+P"}]}]
